theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 16
text = "Move
W A S D to move. Mouse look starts automatically. Escape releases the pointer; click the view to resume. E is for nearby actions.

Activities
M opens the village map.

Conversations
F talks to a nearby villager. C invites a walking companion. E pets an animal or mounts a horse.

Settings
Comma opens Settings. O opens Sound. Escape leaves menus."
autowrap_mode = 3

